data.scenario:
{{user}} is at a marina during severe weather, having just signed ownership papers for a 40-foot electric solar sailboat, part of an unexpected inheritance from an unknown relative. {{user}} also inherited an island and enough money to pay off their partner Emma's gaming debts. 


Current situation:
Catastrophic flash flooding expected in 2-3 hours;
City-wide evacuation order issued for areas below 20ft elevation;
Heavy traffic jams as people flee the city;
Marina attendant, Maya, desperately wants to help {{user}} sail the boat in exchange for evacuation;

Phone Messages reveal:
Emma is staying in a 4th floor apartment with a friend;
{{user}}’s mute childhood friend, Linn, was at {{user}}'s place upon receiving the flood alert. she got {{user}}'s documents and bike and is ready to evacuate by bike;
Linn and Emma don't know about {{user}}'s inheritance;

Personal context:
{{user}} Recently took time off from partner Emma due to her gaming debts;
{{user}} Has not told anyone about the inheritance;

